    "h1_source": "ON-CHAIN exact-3600s. blk 53046777 (23:01:41Z) -> 53048577 (00:01:41Z). VIRTUAL/DEUS ratio 0.027828577 -> 0.027560947 = -0.9617%; VIRTUAL/USD 0.6236128 -> 0.6282311 = +0.7406%; MARK $0.01735426 -> $0.01731465 = -0.2283%. DexScreener printed h1 -0.86% on the deepest pair - same sign, larger magnitude.",
    "h1_note": "THE HOUR FLIPPED BACK TO ONE-WAY SELLING: 10 swaps, TEN SELLS, ZERO BUYS, 92,548.73 DEUS into the deepest pool. That is the largest one-way sell hour since the 101,983 five-pool dump of 15:53Z yesterday. But the USD mark barely moved (-0.23%) because VIRTUAL/USD rose +0.74% and offset the -0.96% ratio drop. FOUR DIRECTIONAL SELLERS (86,539.48 = 93.5% of the hour) BY tx.from, plus 6,009.24 of arb/structural: (1) 0x8cd54fbd + 55,114.94 DEUS, EIP-7702 (delegate 0x7702cb55), nonce 4, ETH 0; held EXACTLY 55,643.46500 at -1h/-6h/-24h/-7d, 0 at -30d, first funded 2026-10-07 blk 52307511 - an 18-day-old position fully exited, zero retained. (2) 0x4e1e354f + 13,782.83 DEUS via ERC-4337 EntryPoint (outer tx 0x790f7621, tx.from 0xaf061c2d, to 0x0000000071727de22e5e9d8baf0edac6f37da032, selector 0x765e827f); route was 0x4e1e354f -> 0x663dc15d -> pool. EIP-7702 (delegate 0x69007702), nonce 6, held EXACTLY 13,782.832328 at -1h/-6h/-24h/-7d/-30d and 0 at latest: a pre-existing position exited in full. (3) 0x09b383a6 + 5,969.40 DEUS, the established whale trimming 0.28%, still holds 2,164,800.70 (was 2,170,770.10). (4) 0x96949fd5 + 5,805.93 DEUS in TWO IDENTICAL 2,902.96 clips 8 seconds apart, 13,778.66 at -1h -> 7,972.74 now, 0 at -7d/-30d: fresh money taking a one-week profit. Structural remainder: 0x49a782c2 5,866.39 via sink 0x939e398d (still holds 34,249.61); 0x6abea499 2x2,200 round-trip via 0xeb7c90d3; 1,609.24 originating from USDC V3 0x58dBa34e. BOTH LARGE HOLDERS FLAT: 0x7f6aba75 335,249.499443 and 0x6a45ca8b 70,034.140337 byte-identical; 0xf0a04b07 250,000.125225 and 0x9d1c316f 284,371.457830 also flat.",
    "mark_source": "Deepest-pool reserves x VIRTUAL/USD at the same block. Reserves blk 53048577: VIRTUAL 523,886.9302 / DEUS 19,008,306.8555 (token0=VIRTUAL 0x0b3e3284, token1=DEUS 0x940A319B, both 18dp). ratio 0.027560946601 x VIRTUAL $0.6282311 = $0.0173146. VIRTUAL/USD = mean of two live VIRTUAL/USDC V3 pools read at the same block: 0x7CB770D0 (pancakeswap) $0.6279390 and 0x529d2863 (uniswap) $0.6285233.",
    "mark_note": "PREMIUM +0.61%, FIFTH consecutive hour and NARROWING AGAIN: +1.12 -> +1.34 -> +1.04 -> +0.94 -> +0.61. Deepest $0.01731465 vs three USDC V3 venues 0.01722976 / 0.01720974 / 0.01716328 (median $0.01720974, spread 0.39%). DexScreener prints $0.01711 on the deepest pair. The premium kept compressing WHILE the tape turned one-way sell - consistent with TELL 20: convergence is the denominator moving, not an arbitrageur.",
